i></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> \nSince <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"210\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> implies that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"211\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, we obtain that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"212\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false. Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"213\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we must have <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"214\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, we conclude that the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
